  "bodyHash": "2agVXK1sdH0=",
  "content": "<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>建議單人遊玩。</strong></span><br>外面潛伏著一個變形夢魘：一隻擁有詭異智慧且不斷變換形態的生物。在目睹其真身前，便能透過遠處的低語、轉瞬即逝的陰影、微小的異動，以及被注視的壓迫感，感知到它的存在。<br><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>追獵</strong></span> 與 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化</span> </strong>是它可被消滅的兩種形態。<br>然而，你必須找出並摧毀它們的<strong>心<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></strong>，才能徹底消滅它們。<br><br>只要 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化</span></strong> 還存在於你的世界中，你將持續承受 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化詛咒</span> </strong>之苦。<br><br>它不僅僅是狩獵。<br>它還會操控你的思緒。<br><br>你會成為下一個受害者，還是在它的遊戲中存活下來？<br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_bd9c9e4d-0db5-448d-bb92-5e6458141ea5.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"80\"><br><br><br></pre><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>動態遭遇</strong>：<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>假面</strong></span>的出現遵循難以捉摸的模式與觸發條件。<br><br><strong>混亂AI</strong>：<strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">假面</span></strong>的行為模式在每次遊玩時都會變化，讓你始終處於緊張狀態，因其本為混亂而生。<br><br><strong>沉浸感</strong>：透過氛圍、不安事件、以及令人不快的音頻/視覺干擾，營造深度沉浸感。<br><br><strong>多種形態</strong>：遭遇 <strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">假面</span></strong> 的駭人變體，例如 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化</span></strong> 與 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">追獵</span></strong>。<br><br><strong>心臟與弱點</strong>：你必須摧毀 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">追獵</span></strong> 或 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化</span> 的<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></strong> 才能殺死它們。<br><br><strong>屍體與血腥</strong>：遭遇戰後，會留下屍體、血跡、與<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>心</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></strong>，以及強化恐怖氛圍的全新建築結構。<br><br><strong>全新事件與機制</strong>：創新的遊戲玩法轉折，讓你始終保持猜測。<br><br><strong>可配置體驗</strong>：使用 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a></span> </strong>模組調整生成率、強度、行為與特殊事件。（數值越小，頻率越高；數值越大，越稀有。）</pre>\n</div><pre style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_10001d9d-88b3-48ff-be67-cad1ef06d717.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"80\"><br><br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">屍體</span>清潔器</strong><br><br>屍體不會自行消失；你可以清理它們以獲取血肉，用來製作 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">標記裝置</span></strong>，或者讓恐怖留存原地。<br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_e7dc331a-83bb-4014-8037-7dfecbbe7769.png\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span><br><br>對 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>懸掛屍體</strong></span> 或 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>死屍</strong></span> 點擊右鍵以移除。<br><br>使用一次後，清潔器會變髒。<br><br>在水<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"></span>中清洗以重複使用。<br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></span>標記裝置</strong><br><br>根據環境不同，<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">紅心</span></strong> 與 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">灰心</span></strong> 都可能難以定位。此裝置能幫助你辨識需要摧毀的活體心臟。<br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_1665cf33-c5bf-425e-99c7-800e0d519603.png\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span><br><br>手持 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span>臟</span>標記裝置</strong>。<br><br>任何處於 <em>存活</em> 狀態的 <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>灰心</strong></span> 或 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>紅心</strong></span> 將獲得 <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>發光效果</strong></span>，使其更容易被發現。<br><br>只有在手持裝置時才會持續發光。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_0095b49c-974b-49e9-b65d-4b552a5d3da6.png\" width=\"227\" height=\"74\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Upsidedowntree</span><em><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"> </span>- 美術/3D美術 + 動畫</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">VantablackDEV</span> - 遊戲測試員/助手</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Knvifrr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knvif</a> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">假面</span></strong> </span>聲音靈感來源</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Monty</span></span></span><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> - 動畫 + 程式碼</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">Brguiireal - 遊戲測試員/助手</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">TournamenU</span> - 美術/3D美術</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">ClouddyVR</span><em> - 動畫</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Ebalia</span></span></span><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> - 構思 + 程式碼</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em>Nempth <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 構思 + 美術</span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#4069c6\"><em><br></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_4bed5646-5f75-4a00-9b7a-99f313ebc9eb.png\" width=\"148\" height=\"148\"></a></span></pre>",
